---
import ServiceLayout from '../../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
import FAQSchema from '../../components/FAQSchema.astro';
import { serviceFAQs } from '../../data/serviceFAQs';
import { getService } from '../../data/services';

const service = getService('womens-cut-finish');

const pageTitle = "Women's Cut & Finish, $70, Kaukapakapa";
const pageDescription = "Women's hairdresser in Kaukapakapa, North Auckland. Cut, wash and blow-dry finish for $70, about 45 to 60 minutes. Kids' cuts too. Open Sundays.";
const pageKeywords = "womens haircut kaukapakapa, hair styling helensville, professional hair cut wainui, hair salon waitoki, womens hair cut north auckland, hair styling rodney";

const faqs = serviceFAQs['womens-cut-finish'];
---

<ServiceLayout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  keywords={pageKeywords}
  price={service.price}
  duration={service.duration}
  h1={service.h1}
  serviceName={service.name}
  image="/images/optimized/hair-care-general_800.webp"
>
  <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Looking for a women's hairdresser near Helensville, Waitoki or Wainui? A women's cut and finish with Melissa is $70 and takes about 45 to 60 minutes, with a wash, cut and blow-dry finish. It's one client at a time in a quiet home salon in Kaukapakapa, with free parking at the door.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Precision Cuts Tailored to Your Unique Style</h2>
  
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    A women's cut with Melissa starts with a chat about your hair, your routine and what you want. You leave with a cut that's easy to look after at home.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">How your appointment goes</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Every great haircut starts with a thorough consultation. Melissa takes the time to understand your hair goals, daily routine, and styling preferences. Whether you're looking for a dramatic change or a subtle refresh, she'll guide you toward a style that enhances your natural beauty and fits seamlessly into your lifestyle.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">What's Included</h2>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
    <li>In-depth consultation to discuss your vision and lifestyle needs</li>
    <li>Relaxing shampoo with scalp massage using premium products</li>
    <li>Precision cutting techniques customised to your hair type</li>
    <li>Professional blow-dry and styling to showcase your new look</li>
    <li>Personalised styling tips and product recommendations</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Cutting Techniques We Offer</h2>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
    <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Classic Cuts</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Timeless styles including bobs, layers, and one-length cuts</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Modern Styles</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Contemporary cuts like pixies, shags, and textured layers</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Precision Techniques</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Point cutting, slide cutting, and razor techniques for movement</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Corrective Cutting</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Fix previous cuts and create balanced, flattering shapes</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">The Perfect Cut for Your Face Shape</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Understanding face shapes is crucial for creating the most flattering haircut. Melissa's expertise in facial analysis ensures your cut enhances your best features:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
    <li><strong>Oval faces:</strong> Nearly any style works, from pixie cuts to long layers</li>
    <li><strong>Round faces:</strong> Longer styles with height at the crown create elongation</li>
    <li><strong>Square faces:</strong> Soft layers and side-swept fringes soften angular features</li>
    <li><strong>Heart faces:</strong> Chin-length bobs and side parts balance proportions</li>
    <li><strong>Long faces:</strong> A fringe and width-adding layers create balance</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Kids' Cuts</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Melissa cuts kids' hair at any age, gently and unhurried, which helps if yours aren't keen on hairdressers. With one client at a time, it's a calm place for a first haircut. Ask about kids' pricing when you book.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Open Sundays</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Hair By Melissa is open 7 days, including Sundays from 9am to 5pm, so you don't have to fit a haircut around the working week. <a href="/booking/" class="text-salon-darkblue underline hover:text-[#0F7A9C]">See available times</a>. Got an event coming up? Read <a href="/blog/christmas-wedding-ball-hair/" class="text-salon-darkblue underline hover:text-[#0F7A9C]">when to book Christmas, wedding and ball hair</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Maintenance Tips</h2>
  <div class="bg-[#FFDEE2] bg-opacity-20 rounded-lg p-6 mb-6">
    <h3 class="font-semibold mb-3">Keep Your Cut Looking Fresh:</h3>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
      <li>Schedule trims every 6-8 weeks to maintain your style's shape</li>
      <li>Use recommended products for your specific hair type</li>
      <li>Follow Melissa's personalised styling techniques</li>
      <li>Protect your hair with heat protectant before styling</li>
      <li>Sleep on a silk pillowcase to reduce friction and maintain style</li>
      <li>Deep condition weekly to keep hair healthy between visits</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Why people come back</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Melissa's approach to cutting goes beyond technical skill. She considers your hair's natural texture, growth patterns, and density to create a cut that works with your hair, not against it. This means easier styling, better grow-out, and a cut that looks great even on those rushed mornings.
  </p>
  <!-- FAQ Schema -->
  <Fragment slot="after">
    <FAQSchema 
      faqs={faqs} 
      pageUrl="https://hairbymelissa.co.nz/services/womens-cut-finish/"
    />
  </Fragment>
</ServiceLayout>